# TripMate – AI Trip Planner & Map Integration 📍
## Phase 6 & Phase 7 — Detailed Implementation Report

**Project:** TripMate – AI Powered Collaborative Trip Planner
**Status:** Phase 6 Completed | Phase 7 Completed

---

# 1. Overview

TripMate is a collaborative trip planning platform, and two major phases have been added to it:

- **Phase 6 (AI Trip Planner):** Uses Google Gemini AI to automatically generate a structured, day-wise itinerary based on trip details (destination, dates, budget, travelers).
- **Phase 7 (Map Integration):** Uses Geoapify APIs together with the Leaflet library to build an interactive map that visualizes the destination and lets users find nearby places such as hospitals, hotels, restaurants, petrol pumps, and tourist attractions.

Together, these two phases turn TripMate from a simple "planner" into an **intelligent, geospatial-aware assistant** — the user gets AI-generated suggestions as well as real-world location data.

