# 5. How the Two Phases Connect

- Phase 6 (AI) suggests **"what to do"** — itinerary, hotels, food.
- Phase 7 suggests **"where it is"** — actual locations, nearby options.
- Both are integrated as separate tabs on the `TripDetails.jsx` page — the user can view AI suggestions and locate them on the map, all from the same page.

This combination makes TripMate not just a static itinerary app, but an **AI + geospatial intelligent planner**.

