# 9. Overall Summary

Phase 6 introduces an AI-powered itinerary generation system using the **Google Gemini API** — including day-wise planning, budget estimation, hotel recommendations, food suggestions, a packing checklist, travel tips, and safety recommendations. The generated data is cached in MongoDB and can be regenerated whenever needed.

Phase 7 integrates **Geoapify APIs** with **Leaflet** to deliver an interactive map experience. Users can visualize destinations and search for nearby hospitals, hotels, restaurants, petrol pumps, and tourist attractions. Dynamic markers, geolocation support, and real-time map rendering together create a complete travel-planning experience.

Together, these two phases combine Artificial Intelligence with real-world geospatial services, making TripMate an intelligent and interactive collaborative trip-planning platform.

